    "description": "What: On demo-city, with SUMO background traffic (600 cars, seed 1), four APCs ('Escort 1'..'Escort 4') drive south down the avenue inside the terrain world (e_d_3_6_d_3_5 → e_d_3_5_d_3_4, x 145.2; the world is [0, 800]², where our own planner works) as a road convoy: 'Escort 1' handed to SUMO (ConvoyOrder, Mode Traffic, 9 m/s), the others on its path — to (220, 525), 62 m east of the road (nearest the NORTHBOUND carriageway), OFF the SUMO network. The lead leaves SUMO where the network ends nearest the destination (mode 1 → 2) and drives the off-road leg on our own route; the column follows it off the road. Judge: (1) the lead runs PlatformConvoy and is handed to SUMO; (2) it leaves SUMO; (3) it reaches the off-road destination; (4) the column never splits; (5) the tail ends near it. Check: scripts/scenario-regression.sh cv-mode-1-to-2"
